<div class="page">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:44rem;">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="overline">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="page-title">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="section-sub">Last updated <%= getYear() %></p>
    </div>

    <div class="stack" style="gap:var(--sp-6);">
      <section>
        <h2 class="card-title">1. What upscnotes is</h2>
        <p class="muted" style="margin-top:var(--sp-2);">
          upscnotes is a subscription-free digital library. A single payment grants a personal,
          non-transferable, perpetual right to read every book in the catalogue through your
          own account.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="card-title">2. Your account</h2>
        <p class="muted" style="margin-top:var(--sp-2);">
          You are responsible for keeping your credentials confidential and for activity that happens
          under your account. One account is for one person. Accounts are not to be shared, resold or
          used to build a public mirror of the library.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="card-title">3. Acceptable use</h2>
        <p class="muted" style="margin-top:var(--sp-2);">
          You may read, search, listen to and print individual pages for your own study. You may not
          bulk-download, scrape, systematically copy, or redistribute the library, nor automate access
          against the service. We may suspend accounts that do.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="card-title">4. Content and copyright</h2>
        <p class="muted" style="margin-top:var(--sp-2);">
          The books are published works held under licence for the use of our members. upscnotes holds
          no claim of authorship over them. Study tools built on top — question banks, flashcards,
          timelines and glossaries — are original to upscnotes.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="card-title">5. Payments and refunds</h2>
        <p class="muted" style="margin-top:var(--sp-2);">
          Payments are processed by Razorpay. Lifetime access is covered by the 7-day money-back
          guarantee described in the <a href="/refunds">refund policy</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="card-title">6. Availability</h2>
        <p class="muted" style="margin-top:var(--sp-2);">
          We aim to keep the library available continuously but do not guarantee uninterrupted service.
          Text-to-speech uses your device's own speech engine and therefore depends on your operating
          system rather than on us.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="card-title">7. Changes</h2>
        <p class="muted" style="margin-top:var(--sp-2);">
          We may update these terms. Material changes will be announced in the app before they take
          effect. Continuing to use the service after that constitutes acceptance.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="card-title">8. Contact</h2>
        <p class="muted" style="margin-top:var(--sp-2);">
          Questions about these terms: <a href="mailto:support@upscnotes.shop">support@upscnotes.shop</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>